---
/**
 * Server-rendered stand-in for the Pipeline island, shown until React hydrates.
 *
 * Blocks rather than words: it is aria-hidden, so it exists to hold the window's shape and stop the
 * tab strip jumping when the island arrives, not to say anything. A tall head, because the toolbar
 * here is eight rows of filter buttons rather than the feed's three.
 */
---

<div class="ev-skel" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="ev-skel-head"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-head"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-card ev-skel-card--short"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-card ev-skel-card--short"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-card ev-skel-card--short"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-card ev-skel-card--short"></div>
</div>
